4. Kubernetes Deployment Example
yaml
Copy
apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: Deployment
spec:
  template:
    spec:
      containers:
      - name: app
        image: your-image:latest
        env:
          - name: AZURE_OPENAI_ENDPOINT
            value: "https://your-endpoint.openai.azure.com"
          - name: AZURE_OPENAI_KEY
            valueFrom:
              secretKeyRef:
                name: azure-secrets
                key: api-key
          - name: GITLAB_PROJECT_ID
            value: "12345"
          - name: GITLAB_PRIVATE_TOKEN
            valueFrom:
              secretKeyRef:
                name: gitlab-secrets
                key: token
Key Changes:
Direct OS Environment Access:

Uses os.getenv() instead of Pydantic validation

No complex validation logic

Default values handled in code

Mandatory Variables Check:
Add startup validation in your FastAPI app:

python
Copy
from fastapi import FastAPI
from app.config import config

app = FastAPI()

@app.on_event("startup")
async def verify_config():
    required = [
        config.AZURE_OPENAI_ENDPOINT,
        config.AZURE_OPENAI_KEY,
        config.GITLAB_PROJECT_ID,
        config.GITLAB_PRIVATE_TOKEN
    ]
    
    if None in required:
        missing = [name for name, value in zip(
            ["AZURE_OPENAI_ENDPOINT", "AZURE_OPENAI_KEY", 
             "GITLAB_PROJECT_ID", "GITLAB_PRIVATE_TOKEN"], 
            required) if value is None]
            
        raise RuntimeError(f"Missing required environment variables: {missing}")
